Here Are the Linux Questions They Asked Me – With Answers! 🐧☁️


Here are the 🔥 Linux Questions I Was Asked (with quick answers):
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
✅ 1. How to run a program in the background?
command &

✅ 2. /bin vs /sbin vs /opt vs /root

/bin: User commands

/sbin: Admin commands

/opt: Optional apps

/root: Root user’s home


✅ 3. Essential Linux log files?
/var/log/messages, /var/log/syslog, /var/log/auth.log, /var/log/cloud-init.log

✅ 4. Root directories in Linux?
/, /etc, /home, /usr, /var, etc.

✅ 5. Create an empty file?
touch filename

✅ 6. Delete files older than 30 days?
find /var/log -type f -mtime +30 -delete

✅ 7. Rename a file?
mv oldname newname

✅ 8. What is a CRON job?
Scheduled tasks – crontab -e to edit jobs

✅ 9. Copy files between servers?
scp file user@host:/path

✅ 10. Mount a volume (e.g., EBS)?
mount /dev/xvdf1 /mnt/data

✅ 11. Fix full disk on EC2?
Resize EBS + growpart + resize2fs

✅ 12. Linux OS Architecture?
Kernel + Shell + Utilities + File System

✅ 13. Check Linux version?
uname -a or cat /etc/os-release

✅ 14. DNS troubleshooting?
Check /etc/resolv.conf, dig, nslookup

✅ 15. What is iptables?
Linux firewall – manages traffic rules

✅ 16. Check if a port is open?
telnet, nc -zv host port

✅ 17. Count words/lines in a file?
wc -w filename, wc -l filename

✅ 18. Change file format?
Rename: mv file.txt file.conf

✅ 19. chmod vs chown?
chmod: Permissions
chown: Ownership

✅ 20. grep vs egrep?
egrep = grep -E (extended regex)

✅ 21. top vs htop?
htop is better visual, interactive

✅ 22. kill vs kill -9?
kill: graceful
kill -9: forceful

✅ 23. Zombie vs Orphan process?

Zombie: Done, waiting for parent

Orphan: Parent gone, adopted by init


✅ 24. What is PATH variable?
Tells shell where to look for commands

✅ 25. Get specific log using grep?
grep "ERROR" /var/log/app.log

✅ 26. Add user in Linux?
sudo useradd username && passwd username

